    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a 2D hack n smash with Metroidvania features, mainly focusing on the Stylish Combo combat,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with simple combination of button press to perform difference Assault-Skill, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no complex command-input is needed, but still able to create your own style combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build the play style by the choosing the Sub-Gadget , passive Equipment and the level adjustable Assault-Skill. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suffering of too few Teleport point ?? no , we got stage selection \t</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania inspired, but with a bit twisted\t</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the features of metroidvania, instead of interconnected 1 huge map, it separated by 8\u00a0 Island and each Island got more than 1 area for you to discover,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Decrease the time for back-tracking in huge map running or the suffer of lack of Teleport point.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separated some game content which not everyone enjoyed such as &quot;death chasing&quot; / &quot;the precise jumping&quot; to Challenge Mission, which is not blocking to the main mission.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beating all the Enemy by your Morphose Arms!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/197ec03a2b7e6b08b08eea849cc6e37a.poster.avif?t=1746774883\" width=562 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/197ec03a2b7e6b08b08eea849cc6e37a.webm?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/197ec03a2b7e6b08b08eea849cc6e37a.mp4?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you are skilled , preform stylish Combo! Mixing basic Attack and Assault-Skill , do your crazy Combo !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breaking Enemy`s Armor-Bar and do your Combos!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/ee1f080860dbda799bad510d6b73c229.poster.avif?t=1746774883\" width=562 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/ee1f080860dbda799bad510d6b73c229.webm?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/ee1f080860dbda799bad510d6b73c229.mp4?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically break the Armor bar, stylishly do the Combo !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilizing Sub-Gadget to assist your perform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/b244256dbfd56d4f166638bc69fc725a.poster.avif?t=1746774883\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/b244256dbfd56d4f166638bc69fc725a.webm?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338510/extras/b244256dbfd56d4f166638bc69fc725a.mp4?t=1746774883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 Sub-Gadget you can equip on each time you go into 